# -------------------------------------------------------------
# 1-Bit Full Adder (Synthesized / Transformed Architecture)
# Inputs: a, b, cin
# Outputs: sum, cout
# Carry implemented via 3-term majority gate: (a&b) | (b&cin) | (a&cin)
# -------------------------------------------------------------
CIRCUIT full_adder_syn
INPUT a b cin
OUTPUT sum cout

# Sum logic
GATE s_xor1 XOR s_t1 a b
GATE s_xor2 XOR sum s_t1 cin

# Carry majority logic
GATE c_and1 AND c_m1 a b
GATE c_and2 AND c_m2 b cin
GATE c_and3 AND c_m3 a cin
GATE c_or1  OR  c_t1 c_m1 c_m2
GATE c_or2  OR  cout c_t1 c_m3

END
